        "A Date as local civil time is unsupported (local-zone), with no candidate; an Invalid Date is invalid; a zone outside the rules is unsupported.",
        "To a Date: lossless at millisecond precision; sub-millisecond digits are floored and reported; a fixed offset is reported dropped; zoned and floating date-times and instants beyond the Date range are unsupported.",
